{"id": "DfOeskUSmCO", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "Bachpan ke mele se ek mitti ka dil liya tha, hum paanchon ka… aaj usme chaar daraarein hain 💔\n\nEk ne meri cycle li aur kabhi lautayi nahi. Ek ne meri shayari ki copy ke panne hawa mein uda diye. Ek meri mohabbat ka haath pakad ke chala gaya.\nAur jab papa ka janaza gali se guzra… chauthe ki khidki ki batti jali, parda hila, aur batti bujh gayi.\nPhir main dargah ki jaali pe gaya. Badla lene nahi… chaar dhaage baandhne, chaaron ke liye ek-ek mannat.\nHar gaanth ke saath ek daraar sona ban gayi.\n\n🎵 Jitne Bhi Zakhm Hain Mere Dil Par · Nusrat Fateh Ali Khan\n\nUsko bhejo jiske liye aaj bhi dua nikalti hai… chahe usne jo bhi kiya ho 🤍\n\nNusrat Fateh Ali Khan | NFAK | qawwali | dargah | mannat ka dhaaga | bachpan ke dost | dosti | maafi | kintsugi | painted animation | lyrics reel\n\n#NusratFatehAliKhan #Qawwali #Dosti", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1793594887, "like_count": 164, "comment_count": 1, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1802678977710700a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 73.512, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPDolNVuyFKcThiDJwAlWc93AE14DS58PWMVcE4h8dMAFBlLss3xDX4wOTJzs_kEaN7t8NUMkoUkn7JD1_Ho7r5MRacKkn4dZudHxw.mp4?_nc_cat=107&_nc_oc=AdqoSgq7YHOc4qS_3ODVb7cm7eiUWLTtXOcBkuE_xzWdVJ_4QdWx457V6Caf9HwARNt3uwcyEXSOPh72hFR9mMGF&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=mBg1bvx_1EwQ7kNvwHnIemX&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=ZJOCI_4E6rg8tvXDFsCLrA&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQTJ0Igp2vXDjPM5Oh--3-zQbafn-NprQhmF6Vrsx-diew&oe=6AF4193C", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 73.512, "resolution": "audi